** 花蓮港音頭 **
~ "作曲：岡本新市"
~ "tag: collection:kayocho_taiwan_angya"
~ "tag: volume:1"
~ "tag: source:taiwan_tetsudo_1938"
~ "tag: source_page:n309_p46-p47"
